---
import Header from '../components/header.kay'
import { feedPath } from '../site'
import '../app.css'
---
head
  link(rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="devlog" href={feedPath})
a.skip-link(href="#main-content") Skip to main content
Header
main#main-content.w-full.grow.px-4.py-10.sm:px-8
  slot
footer.border-t-2.border-surface.px-4.py-4.text-sm.text-muted.sm:px-8
  | Built with #[a(href="https://git.kaynooo.fr/kaynooo/kayjs") kay], served as static files.
